# By🇭🇷PhonkAlphabet
Package: blueteam-aio
Version: 1.3.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BlueTeam Security <security@blueteam.io>
Depends: python3, python3-psutil, python3-bcc, yara, auditd
Description: BlueTeam AIO - Production-Grade Security Platform
 Complete cybersecurity platform with 21 modules:
 - Kernel & Runtime Security (eBPF monitoring, rootkit detection)
 - Memory Forensics (Volatility integration, injection detection)
 - Network Defense (C2 detection, honeytokens, ARP spoofing)
 - File Integrity & Anti-Ransomware (entropy detection, FIM)
 - EDR Core (process tree, Sigma rules, MITRE ATT&CK)
 - SIEM (log collection, correlation, NLP search)
 - Vulnerability Scanner, IR Orchestration, Malware Sandbox
 - Hardening, Cloud/Container Security, Reporting
 - AI/GGUF Integration, REST API, TUI/Web UI
